.TH TKARCADE 1 "October 2026" "TKArcade" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
tkarcade \- minimal Steam launch wrapper
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B tkarcade
[\fIOPTIONS\fR] [\fB--\fR] [\fICOMMAND\fR...]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Minimal Steam launch wrapper (inspired by steamtinkerlaunch). Use in
Steam as \fBtkarcade %command%\fR. The Steam AppID resolves
automatically from the Steam environment. Per-game settings live in
TOML snapshots under \fB$XDG_CONFIG_HOME/tkarcade/\fR; run without
arguments (or with \fB--gui\fR) for the settings GUI.
.PP
Steam games launch through their Steam Proton runtime (\fBproton\fR) or
natively (\fBnative\fR); local games through \fBnative\fR, a Wine binary
(\fBwine\fR) or Proton via \fBumu-run\fR (\fBumu\fR). Local Windows
prefixes default to \fB$XDG_DATA_HOME/tkarcade/prefixes/<appid>\fR and
may install DXVK and/or vkd3d-proton into the prefix at launch.
.PP
Logs go to \fB$XDG_STATE_HOME/tkarcade/games/<appid>.log\fR (full)
plus a one-line entry per run in \fBlauncher.log\fR.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR --gui
Open the settings GUI and exit (needs a display).
.TP
.BR --cli
Never open the GUI, even without a command (for scripts).
.TP
.BR --appid " AppID"
Steam AppID (else STEAMAPPID env).
.TP
.BR --dry-run
Print final command, do not run.
.TP
.BR --list
List configured/detected games and exit.
.TP
.BR --validate
Check configs and helper binaries, exit 17 on issues.
.TP
.BR --export " FILE"
Export configs to a tar.gz and exit.
.TP
.BR --import " FILE"
Import configs from a tar.gz and exit.
.TP
.BR --edit
Open the game settings dialog (needs a display); takes an optional
positional AppID, otherwise shows a game picker.
.TP
.BR --menu
Show the pre-launch menu before starting the game (needs a display;
launches directly without one).
.TP
.BR --verbose
Debug logging to the per-game log.
.TP
.BR --version
Print the version and exit.
.SH EXIT CODES
0 ok: game ran (its own code), or menu/editor exited without launching.
10 AppID not resolved. 11 empty game command. 12 pre-launch hook
failed. 13 game executable not found. 14 custom prefix, wine/umu runtime
or Proton install not found. 15 display needed but missing. 16
export/import failed. 17 validation issues found. 18 environment not set
(or invalid for the game's origin).
.SH FILES
.TP
.I $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/tkarcade/games/<appid>.toml
Per-game config snapshot (carries a \fBconfig_version\fR stamp).
.TP
.I $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/tkarcade/profiles/<appid>/<name>.toml
Named per-game profiles.
.TP
.I $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/tkarcade/defaults.toml
New-game template only.
.TP
.I $XDG_DATA_HOME/tkarcade/prefixes/<appid>/
Local Windows Wine prefix (default base; Preferences or the per-game
\fBruntime.prefix\fR can move it). TKArcade writes
\fBtkarcade-graphics.json\fR here when a DXVK/vkd3d layer is installed.
.SH "SEE ALSO"
